{"title":"Gold Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 35) · Monster drop: Thak Footman, Dune Skirmisher</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · STR 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 35 <span class=\"muted\">(1373 XP)</span> from 4× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (3 / 663 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (2 / 935 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gold-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/gold-head\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"gold-head\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\">Leopard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"sage\">Sage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"mage\">Mage</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Protection comes from the armor of all five pieces together, up to 75%.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>A full set of it protects</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>1.7 armor · 0.6 magic defense</td><td>28% blows · 12% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>1.9 armor · 0.7 magic defense</td><td>30% blows · 14% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>2.2 armor · 0.8 magic defense</td><td>33% blows · 15% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>2.4 armor · 0.9 magic defense</td><td>35% blows · 17% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">3 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>2.6 armor · 1 magic defense</td><td>37% blows · 18% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>2.9 armor · 1.1 magic defense</td><td>40% blows · 20% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>3.1 armor · 1.2 magic defense</td><td>41% blows · 21% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-head?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>3.3 armor · 1.2 magic defense</td><td>43% blows · 22% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Inferior ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Armor Smithing 35): the higher above 35 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"gold-head\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>35 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>40 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>45 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>50 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>55 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>58 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>60 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>65 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">No Inferior drops of it recorded yet.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ee24cd14c85838124a1a.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/cfe3b115bd1a52814608.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b0a1dcb7a8a29c4f1ffd.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/thak-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/3ac35c611863522f1e9d.svg\" alt=\"\">Thak Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/leather-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ad0df36ce44572a810c0.svg\" alt=\"\">Leather Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1981696ba13bfd1bd890.svg\" alt=\"\">Dunehide Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/dragonhide-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/8aff54adaf9a41658e77.svg\" alt=\"\">Dragonhide Head</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/264420239c726a73de34.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Bar</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-inferior\"><img src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"Gold Head\"><span id